<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Compliance Confirmation</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        padding: 30px;
      }
      .logo {
        font-weight: bold;
        font-size: 24px;
        color: #1c1c1c;
      }
      .heading {
        font-size: 20px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
      }
      ul {
        margin-left: 20px;
      }
      .checkbox {
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 40px;
      }
      .signature {
        margin-top: 10px;
        border-top: 1px solid #000;
        width: 250px;
        padding-top: 10px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="logo">Zomo<span style="color: #007f7f;">health</span></div>

    <div class="heading">
      Please confirm that your submitted program complies with all applicable regulations, standards, and guidelines.
    </div>

    <p>By clicking "I Agree," you acknowledge and affirm that:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Your program meets all relevant legal, regulatory, and industry compliance requirements.</li>
      <li>You have conducted appropriate due diligence to ensure compliance.</li>
      <li>You accept full responsibility for the accuracy and integrity of the information provided.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="checkbox">
      {{#if checkboxValue}}☑{{else}}☐{{/if}} I Agree
    </div>

    <p>
      By selecting this option, you confirm your program is compliant and accept the terms above.<br />
      <span style="color: #007f7f;">
        Contact your benefits broker or compliance team if you have any questions or concerns.
      </span>
    </p>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Date: {{date}}</p>
      <div class="signature">Signature: {{signatureLabel}}</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
